OL,3,GNEWSAViolence between inmates persists
OL,4,Aat prison - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FViolence between inmates remained high
OL,7,Fat an overcrowded Victorian prison, a
OL,8,Fwatchdog has found.
OL,10,FHM Inspectorate of Prisons revisited
OL,11,FHMP Leicester in August following
OL,12,Fconcerns raised by inspectors during
OL,13,Ftheir last full inspection in 2025.
OL,15,FThe Independent Review Progress (IRP)
OL,16,Freport published on Monday, also
OL,17,Fhighlighted inmates continued to face
OL,18,Flong delays for mental health
OL,19,Ftransfers, cells still in poor
OL,20,Fcondition and the facility's overall
OL,21,Fuse of force remained among the highest
OL,22,Fin the country.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
