OL,3,GNEWSAViolence between inmates persists
OL,4,Aat prison - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the report, the Ministry
OL,7,Fof Justice (MoJ), which runs the prison
OL,8,Fon Welford Road, said a number of
OL,9,Fimprovements were noted but admitted
OL,10,Fthere was "more to do".
